%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 043bf15b2a6a41c48971e11c678f419c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 472199573504
    m_Localized: Why'd you skip all the tasty fruit and eat me instead?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334352332992512
    m_Localized: 'Colored tiles are gonna pop up on the floor.

      Stand on one
      for 2 seconds to score a point.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334425666203648
    m_Localized: 'Anyone can use white or black tiles, but a colored tile only counts
      for that color.

      Stay out of each other''s way and move fast!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335177390338048
    m_Localized: 'When your color shows up on the floor, hit <color=#FFD24D><b>Space</b></color>.

      Anyone
      can hit white, but don''t touch black!

      Black passes to the next turn
      on its own after 1 second.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335182629023744
    m_Localized: 'Something''s moving under our feet... watch out!

      Here comes
      the tongue!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335185439207424
    m_Localized: "The tongue's gonna smash the middle platform and block the way.\nShout
      the team cheer together and it'll go back down \u2014 the broken path will
      be restored, too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335887280484352
    m_Localized: Is he working out or something? His breathing suddenly got rough!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335890795311104
    m_Localized: Haah... haah... just a little more and we might actually make it
      out alive...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337052009345024
    m_Localized: '...It''s gone quiet in here.

      Does that mean we can finally
      escape...?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337056501444608
    m_Localized: .....(CRUNCH!)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337060553142272
    m_Localized: Oh no, we're being swallowed...!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337070598500352
    m_Localized: "We got swallowed... now we're in the esophagus.\nNo choice now
      \u2014 we've gotta head down and find a way out."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337897539088384
    m_Localized: 'The esophagus is gonna squeeze in on us.

      When the warning
      pops up, shout the team cheer together to stop it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337902496755712
    m_Localized: "Colored walls are gonna close in from both sides.\nIf a wall shows
      my color, ram right into it \u2014 that'll push it back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337904153505792
    m_Localized: 'I think gas is building up in the esophagus...

      If it gets
      too thick to see, shout the team cheer to clear it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337904874926080
    m_Localized: Remember my color and move along the tiles that match it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337906154188800
    m_Localized: The zone's color has to go first, then the path's gonna be safe.
      Don't cut in line!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337906812694528
    m_Localized: The esophagus suddenly convulsed and the passage got blocked off!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337907517337600
    m_Localized: One of us runs down below. Everyone else, step on the color pads
      to open the doors!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339357207212032
    m_Localized: 'This is the end of the esophagus...

      It''s gotta be full
      of stomach acid down there. It''s dangerous to go down without preparation.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339360646541312
    m_Localized: 'That candy from before is falling from the ceiling.

      We''ve
      gotta stop it before it hits the ground!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340094578438144
    m_Localized: 'Phew... we barely stopped it...

      Now let''s figure out how
      to get down safely.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340096402960384
    m_Localized: 'Gulp... gulp...

      He''s choking, so he started drinking water!
      The candy''s coming down!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000001
    m_Localized: From now on, just focus on staying alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000002
    m_Localized: 'Remember where the colored mouths around you are.

      Step on
      the pad, and that color''s mouth will rise up and smash the teeth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000003
    m_Localized: 'Only one color rises at a time.

      Stepping on it together
      won''t help.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000004
    m_Localized: 'When the giant mouth starts to close, everyone shout the team cheer!

      Otherwise
      everything will go dark.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000005
    m_Localized: Match each zone's KKUL-TTEOK count! You only see your own sign's,
      so call them out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000006
    m_Localized: 'Did he eat something spicy before he ate me..?

      Drool keeps
      bubbling up from the floor.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000007
    m_Localized: 'All this drool''s gonna make the floor slippery.

      Shout the
      team cheer together and we can clear it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000008
    m_Localized: 'Now it''s dripping from above too!

      He must''ve eaten something
      spicy and sour.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000009
    m_Localized: 'Some of the falling drool is targeting me!

      Match my color
      to the floor with <color=#FFD24D><b>Ctrl</b></color> and it''ll lose track
      of me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000010
    m_Localized: 'From now on, you''ll only see one tile ahead.

      Make sure
      you remember it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000011
    m_Localized: 'Something''s targeting me here too!

      Match my color to the
      floor with <color=#FFD24D><b>Ctrl</b></color> and it''ll lose track of me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000012
    m_Localized: "This time, the tongue's gonna smash the whole left or right side
      of the floor.\nShout the team cheer to stop it \u2014 if you don't, it's gonna
      break."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000013
    m_Localized: 'The floor only comes back if you shout the team cheer while the
      warning''s up.

      Once it''s broken, you''ll just have to hang on until
      the next warning.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337130970394624
    m_Localized: Is that candy rolling up behind us?! Run unless you wanna get flattened!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131016531969
    m_Localized: 'Feels like acid reflux... stomach acid''s coming up!

      If
      we don''t clear each section before the sign''s timer runs out, we''re gonna
      be swimming in it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131016531972
    m_Localized: Must be an allergic reaction... the esophagus is all swollen up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12337131016531973
    m_Localized: Only one color of door opens at a time. Something's chasing us,
      so hurry!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13504475839442944
    m_Localized: "Colored tiles are gonna light up on the floor.\nIf your color shows
      up, stand on that tile only.\nIf it doesn't, hang on to black or white \u2014
      whichever matches you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17908244660465664
    m_Localized: 'It''s gotten so sensitive that only one of us can stand on each
      tile.

      Some tiles break easily, so react fast!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
